<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>= - 标签 - 宋明的博客</title><link>https://apolla.cc/tags/</link><description>宋明的博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.170.0 &amp; FixIt v1.0.0-rc.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 14:55:01 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://apolla.cc/tags/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>运算符重载</title><link>https://apolla.cc/posts/swift/%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E7%AC%A6%E9%87%8D%E8%BD%BD/</link><pubDate>Mon, 15 Apr 2024 14:55:01 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://apolla.cc/posts/swift/%E8%BF%90%E7%AE%97%E7%AC%A6%E9%87%8D%E8%BD%BD/</guid><category domain="https://apolla.cc/categories/swift/">Swift</category><description>&lt;p&gt;在C++中, 运算符是可以重载的, Swift也是支持的&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;注：&lt;code&gt;=&lt;/code&gt;和三目运算符&lt;code&gt;a ? b : c&lt;/code&gt;不可重载&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;重载双目运算符&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;class Vector {&#10; var x: Double = 0.0&#10; var y: Double = 0.0&#10; var z: Double = 0.0&#10; &#10; init(x: Double, y: Double, z: Double) {&#10; self.x = x&#10; self.y = y&#10; self.z = z&#10; }&#10; &#10; convenience init() {&#10; self.init(x: 0, y: 0, z: 0) &#10; }&#10; &#10; &#10; &#10; static func &amp;#43;(v1: Vector, v2: Vector) -&amp;gt; Vector {&#10; let vector: Vector = Vector()&#10; vector.x = v1.x &amp;#43; v2.x&#10; vector.y = v1.y &amp;#43; v2.y&#10; vector.z = v1.z &amp;#43; v2.z&#10; return vector&#10; }&#10;} &lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;单目运算符&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>